            <div xml:id="d1153">

                <pb facs="1495" n="1485" sameAs="frus:frus1945v07/pg1485"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.01/5–1945: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Acting Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">San Francisco</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-05-19">May 19,
                        1945</date>.<lb/>[Received May 19—7:43 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>7. Your 20, May 18. Please tell McCloy that I shall be guided by your advice on
                    this matter in my conversations with Soong.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
